      "message": "The hardware behavior is the same (pulsing learn mode for 50 ms to exit CCM), except it no longer blocks k_sys_work_q during those 50 ms. Because of that, the test actually fails at ToT: at ToT, hook_notify() sleeps for the full 50 ms and clears ISL9241_CONTROL1_LEARN_MODE before returning, whereas with the deferred callback learn mode is still set when hook_notify() returns and clears after 50 ms. Simplified the test to make this clearer.",
